WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:02.980
<b>Do it!</b>

00:06.730 --> 00:08.670
<b>These guys are amazing!</b>

00:08.670 --> 00:11.170
<b>No wonder they managed
to survive as cadets!</b>

00:12.240 --> 00:13.930
<b>This is the end, boss monster!</b>

00:13.930 --> 00:16.570
<b>It's time you learn
how superior we humans are!</b>

00:16.570 --> 00:18.490
<b>Go to hell, you damn bastard!</b>

00:18.490 --> 00:20.600
<b>I'll start with you first.</b>

00:21.300 --> 00:23.370
<b>Above you, Yukino!
</b>

00:23.370 --> 00:25.250
<b>Woah!</b>

00:26.750 --> 00:27.850
<b>What…</b>

00:34.150 --> 00:39.490
<b>I wonder if I managed to act
a little more like a hero at the very end.</b>

00:40.820 --> 00:45.600
<b>Ishikawa… We did it.
We defeated the monster.</b>

00:45.600 --> 00:47.130
<b>And it's a boss monster.</b>

00:47.130 --> 00:48.880
<b>That wouldn't just make us
official Rangers.</b>

00:48.880 --> 00:50.940
<b>We're as good as Dragon Keepers!</b>

00:51.580 --> 00:54.950
<b>We did great as the Rangers.</b>

00:57.450 --> 00:59.450
<b>Blue Keeper!</b>

01:01.680 --> 01:02.850
<b>Konno!</b>

01:03.960 --> 01:07.960
<b>T-Take this… It's my cartridge.</b>

01:13.420 --> 01:16.010
<b>Woah, they're all dead!</b>

01:16.010 --> 01:19.010
<b>You did this all alone? What a freak!</b>

01:19.440 --> 01:20.970
<b>That voice…</b>

01:20.970 --> 01:23.980
<b>But there is still
an enemy left.</b>

01:26.490 --> 01:28.900
<b>A monster is right here.</b>

01:28.900 --> 01:31.570
<b>Monsters or the Dragon Keepers…</b>

01:31.570 --> 01:35.900
<b>Time to settle which one of us
will rule the world!</b>

01:42.760 --> 01:47.600
<b>Episode 12
Never Stop, Fighter D!</b>

01:59.400 --> 02:02.320
<b>Where is… this place…</b>

02:06.910 --> 02:09.120
<b>Who… am I?</b>

02:09.540 --> 02:10.900
<b>Who the hell are you guys?</b>

02:10.900 --> 02:12.590
<b>That's my line!</b>

02:12.590 --> 02:15.760
<b>That's my line! The heck's going on?</b>

02:15.760 --> 02:18.340
<b>So these are fighters?
</b>

02:20.620 --> 02:24.640
<b>Compared to us, those on
the surface have the numerical advantage.</b>

02:24.640 --> 02:27.810
<b>So apparently, we'll use these guys
to bridge the difference.</b>

02:27.810 --> 02:30.730
<b>Well, I suppose they'll make for shields.</b>

02:31.470 --> 02:36.210
<b>From today onwards, you guys
will also join in on the surface invasion!</b>

02:36.810 --> 02:40.320
<b>As monsters,
our duty is to achieve world domination!</b>

02:40.320 --> 02:42.910
<b>And we will fight against
the Rangers and the Dragon Keepers,</b>

02:42.910 --> 02:45.390
<b>who prevent us from doing so!</b>

02:45.820 --> 02:47.990
<b>The Dragon Keepers…</b>

03:06.410 --> 03:08.160
<b>Boss monster!</b>

03:08.160 --> 03:09.930
<b>Fighters!</b>

03:10.670 --> 03:14.170
<b>As of now, your bosses are all gone.</b>

03:14.170 --> 03:18.920
<b>As humans and monsters,
why don't we work hand-in-hand to live?</b>

03:20.440 --> 03:21.930
<b>You bastards!
</b>

03:23.930 --> 03:26.350
<b>How dare you kill the boss monsters!</b>

03:32.740 --> 03:36.130
<b>What's wrong?
Why isn't that guy reconstructing?</b>

03:36.130 --> 03:39.190
<b>He can't be dead
from something like that, right?</b>

03:39.960 --> 03:42.420
<b>We have
the Divine Artifacts in our hands!</b>

03:43.030 --> 03:46.550
<b>With these, we can finally mark an end
to this long battle.</b>

03:47.340 --> 03:50.640
<b>The era where humans and monsters
shall co-exist has arrived.</b>

03:51.140 --> 03:54.270
<b>You guys are no longer our enemies.</b>

03:59.050 --> 04:01.240
<b>I'm sure the boss monsters
are still alive.</b>

04:01.240 --> 04:03.110
<b>They're probably waiting for us
on the surface!</b>

04:03.110 --> 04:05.240
<b>Boss monster…
 I'm coming…</b>

04:05.240 --> 04:08.160
<b>Those guys…
They're just going to their deaths!</b>

04:08.160 --> 04:11.560
<b>They know what'll happen to them
if they go against the Dragon Keepers!</b>

04:12.070 --> 04:13.500
<b>Are you not coming?</b>

04:15.910 --> 04:17.250
<b>Don't you understand?</b>

04:17.250 --> 04:20.320
<b>If you go down without permission,
you'll be killed by the Divine Artifacts.</b>

04:20.320 --> 04:21.820
<b>I'm aware of that.</b>

04:21.820 --> 04:24.800
<b>I don't think
what you guys are doing is wrong.</b>

04:24.800 --> 04:27.260
<b>But I don't think it's worth
risking our lives</b>

04:27.260 --> 04:28.830
<b>for any of the boss monsters.</b>

04:29.340 --> 04:30.720
<b>You coward.</b>

04:33.850 --> 04:38.340
<b>Go back! Go back!</b>

04:38.340 --> 04:42.360
<b>Go back! Go back!
</b>

04:46.840 --> 04:48.760
<b>Wait, D!</b>

04:48.760 --> 04:51.290
<b>It's not the combat scene
with the Dragon Keepers yet!</b>

04:51.290 --> 04:53.640
<b>First, we have to pretend
to attack the civilians!</b>

04:53.640 --> 04:54.790
<b>What a pain.</b>

04:54.790 --> 04:57.620
<b>We only have 30 minutes!
Stick to the plan!</b>

05:05.360 --> 05:06.640
<b>Please do not worry.</b>

05:06.640 --> 05:09.620
<b>The Rangers at the stadium
will protect everyone,</b>

05:09.620 --> 05:11.560
<b>so please spectate the battle
with peace of mind.</b>

05:11.560 --> 05:14.370
<b>Who… am I?</b>

05:18.060 --> 05:19.350
<b>I am…</b>

05:20.600 --> 05:23.110
<b>I'll fix the Ranger Force first.</b>

05:24.150 --> 05:28.450
<b>I'm thankful, Sakurama.
From the bottom of my heart.</b>

05:29.110 --> 05:32.120
<b>I'm glad that I went along
with your plan back then.</b>

05:32.970 --> 05:36.730
<b>You… You're not
Sakurama's younger brother.</b>

05:36.730 --> 05:38.080
<b>That's right.</b>

05:38.080 --> 05:40.170
<b>I'm Fighter D…</b>

05:40.170 --> 05:41.730
<b>Your enemy!</b>

05:41.730 --> 05:46.240
<b>This is why I was born.
I have the dignity of a monster.</b>

05:46.240 --> 05:50.490
<b>I'm a true proud monster!</b>

05:50.920 --> 05:53.580
<b>[♪ upbeat music playing,
Tatsuya Kitani "Preview of Me"]</b>

05:55.080 --> 05:57.000
<b>Go! Go! Loser Ranger!</b>

07:22.850 --> 07:25.840
<b>Blue Keeper!
It's for real today.</b>

07:25.840 --> 07:28.340
<b>I'll defeat you right here, right now!</b>

07:28.580 --> 07:31.840
<b>I see… You're Fighter D.</b>

07:33.150 --> 07:35.640
<b>So I didn't manage
to kill you back then.</b>

07:36.360 --> 07:39.200
<b>I'm glad that you appeared
right in front of me.</b>

07:39.200 --> 07:41.850
<b>This time,
I'll make sure to get rid of you!</b>

07:42.830 --> 07:44.500
<b>Huh?
</b>

07:45.610 --> 07:47.900
<b>Crap. Damn it…</b>

07:47.900 --> 07:50.920
<b>Seems like the damage from fighting
the boss monster is still there.</b>

07:50.920 --> 07:53.010
<b>I ain't giving you the chance
to say, "Wait!"</b>

07:53.010 --> 07:55.160
<b>This is the opportune moment for me.</b>

07:55.590 --> 07:57.660
<b>This is nothing.</b>

07:58.220 --> 08:02.430
<b>Personally, this is one fight
I cannot run from too.</b>

08:02.850 --> 08:04.770
<b>For some reason…</b>

08:06.270 --> 08:08.440
<b>I have a feeling that
if I don't kill you now,</b>

08:08.440 --> 08:11.520
<b>you'll be even more troublesome
to deal with than the boss monsters!</b>

08:13.090 --> 08:15.120
<b>That's right, let's fight!</b>

08:15.120 --> 08:17.100
<b>After all, I've already come this far!</b>

08:19.360 --> 08:21.600
<b>I won't hold back!</b>

08:21.600 --> 08:24.600
<b>I shall get rid of humanity's foe
with all of my power!</b>

08:38.990 --> 08:40.750
<b>Burst Form…</b>

08:40.750 --> 08:43.330
<b>I don't know how you know about that,</b>

08:43.330 --> 08:45.880
<b>but it's just a generic weapon
for normal Rangers.</b>

08:46.470 --> 08:49.070
<b>It's nowhere as powerful as
my one and only Divine Artifact,</b>

08:49.070 --> 08:52.300
<b>which has the power
to control the Dragon God!</b>

08:52.300 --> 08:54.550
<b>Dragon God? The heck is that?</b>

08:54.550 --> 08:56.050
<b>It's a deity! Get it?</b>

08:56.050 --> 09:02.660
<b>In any case, what I mean is that
a powerful god is on my side!</b>

09:19.260 --> 09:22.830
<b>With the protection of the Dragon God,
I am invincible.</b>

09:23.430 --> 09:25.720
<b>I will never lose anything again.</b>

09:28.540 --> 09:30.690
<b>Die!</b>

09:31.920 --> 09:34.190
<b>That's not good!</b>

09:37.930 --> 09:41.930
<b>In that case, does that mean
I'm fighting a god now?</b>

09:44.430 --> 09:48.190
<b>And I'm just a fighter!
Man, I can't get enough of this!</b>

09:50.690 --> 09:54.190
<b>Get real! I've got way more cards
up my sleeve than you think!</b>

09:57.880 --> 10:00.700
<b>Crap!</b>

10:06.640 --> 10:09.460
<b>Where the hell did you go?
Don't you run away!</b>

10:09.460 --> 10:11.000
<b>I won't run away!</b>

10:12.930 --> 10:15.210
<b>Blue Keeper! Prepare yourself!</b>

10:15.480 --> 10:17.180
<b>You and your cheap tricks!</b>

10:17.180 --> 10:19.090
<b>You hesitated for a moment!</b>

10:22.240 --> 10:24.720
<b>Don't you look down on a fighter… Huh?</b>

10:26.890 --> 10:29.920
<b>Right, there was that damn barrier…</b>

10:29.920 --> 10:33.270
<b>Just how overpowered is that Dragon God?</b>

10:33.270 --> 10:37.150
<b>No. This belongs to this woman's power.</b>

10:37.150 --> 10:38.400
<b>Woman?</b>

10:38.400 --> 10:41.470
<b>You sure about having a nice chat now?</b>

10:41.470 --> 10:43.450
<b>We're in the middle of a fight!</b>

10:44.450 --> 10:46.700
<b>What--
</b>

10:50.040 --> 10:51.270
<b>This is the end!</b>

10:57.550 --> 10:58.630
<b>What?</b>

11:09.890 --> 11:13.400
<b>You little… Get away from him!</b>

11:22.070 --> 11:26.080
<b>This is a fight between you and me.
I don't need any spectators.</b>

11:27.080 --> 11:28.850
<b>I'm surprised
you can say that so shamelessly</b>

11:28.850 --> 11:31.190
<b>when you're the one who used
cowardly tactics like mimicry!</b>

11:31.190 --> 11:34.350
<b>Hey!
That's my ability, so it's fine!</b>

11:38.340 --> 11:40.490
<b>I'm aware that
I don't have a lot of abilities!</b>

11:40.490 --> 11:43.340
<b>I managed to get all the way here
with just this one trick, so let it slide!</b>

11:43.340 --> 11:45.780
<b>You did rather well for a fighter,</b>

11:45.780 --> 11:48.850
<b>but your insignificant
act of rebellion ends here!</b>

11:48.850 --> 11:51.710
<b>As the Blue Keeper,
a Senior First Rank of the Rangers…</b>

11:51.710 --> 11:55.360
<b>I will defeat you, Fighter D!</b>

11:57.210 --> 12:01.490
<b>I took one heavy blow,
but I feel surprisingly light on my feet.</b>

12:01.490 --> 12:04.260
<b>I'm the evil that schemes
to take over the world,</b>

12:04.260 --> 12:06.760
<b>while he's the hero of justice
trying to stop me.</b>

12:06.760 --> 12:10.000
<b>This battle is simple,
and I like it that way.</b>

12:10.260 --> 12:14.250
<b>This… This is exactly
what I've always wanted…</b>

12:23.380 --> 12:24.610
<b>What?</b>

12:43.170 --> 12:45.630
<b>Well done, D.</b>

12:46.120 --> 12:48.510
<b>This is how we fight.</b>

12:48.510 --> 12:54.120
<b>We worked together and took down
the accursed Dragon Keeper!</b>

12:55.960 --> 12:59.570
<b>Hey, Blue. This isn't the end, right?</b>

12:59.570 --> 13:01.440
<b>This is nothing to you, right?</b>

13:02.270 --> 13:06.550
<b>This must be… my punishment…
</b>

13:06.550 --> 13:10.580
<b>With this power,
everything is within my grasp.</b>

13:10.580 --> 13:13.560
<b>That's why… I became a Dragon Keeper.</b>

13:14.280 --> 13:17.810
<b>I turned a blind eye… to what I've lost…</b>

13:17.810 --> 13:19.230
<b>Just shut up already!</b>

13:19.660 --> 13:22.090
<b>It's meaningless to win like this!</b>

13:22.090 --> 13:23.550
<b>You should be able to heal</b>

13:23.550 --> 13:26.240
<b>a simple wound like this, right?
 Justice… and evil…</b>

13:26.240 --> 13:28.760
<b>A half-baked guy like me…
 You know, use the power…</b>

13:28.760 --> 13:30.740
<b>…lost to the real evil…
…of that Dragon God…</b>

13:31.260 --> 13:33.250
<b>That's all there is to it.</b>

13:40.920 --> 13:42.780
<b>Blue Keeper…</b>

13:42.780 --> 13:45.590
<b>Hey! Don't you dare die on me!</b>

13:45.590 --> 13:47.530
<b>Fight me!</b>

13:50.030 --> 13:54.200
<b>Now then.
Shall we head back, XX?</b>

13:55.030 --> 13:57.600
<b>You damn bastards…</b>

14:01.120 --> 14:02.840
<b>Fighter D!</b>

14:02.840 --> 14:06.110
<b>You should reconsider
your position once again.</b>

14:06.110 --> 14:09.640
<b>We boss monsters created the fighters.</b>

14:09.640 --> 14:13.120
<b>We cannot have
irregularities like you exist.</b>

14:13.120 --> 14:15.870
<b>We are monsters!</b>

14:17.390 --> 14:21.880
<b>Fighters are loyal servants
of the boss monsters.</b>

14:23.180 --> 14:28.630
<b>I'm sorry, D.
This is the only way I know how to live.</b>

14:30.890 --> 14:32.910
<b>Wait! XX!</b>

14:43.650 --> 14:45.420
<b>I-I can't believe this!</b>

14:45.420 --> 14:48.050
<b>To think that Blue Keeper
has been defeated…</b>

14:48.920 --> 14:53.100
<b>Just what cowardly tactics
did that boss monster Peltrola resort to--</b>

14:53.100 --> 14:54.790
<b>You know…</b>

14:54.790 --> 14:56.560
<b>Get a clue.</b>

14:56.560 --> 15:00.420
<b>As someone who lost a precious ally,
can you imagine what I'm thinking now?</b>

15:00.420 --> 15:02.480
<b>Y-Yes! I'm sorry!</b>

15:06.100 --> 15:07.520
<b>Aoshima…</b>

15:09.770 --> 15:11.390
<b>How unfortunate.</b>

15:11.390 --> 15:13.910
<b>Our group victory pose…</b>

15:13.910 --> 15:17.890
<b>Its ideal balance is only achieved
with your height!</b>

15:17.890 --> 15:18.990
<b>What?</b>

15:20.140 --> 15:21.560
<b>Damn it!</b>

15:21.560 --> 15:23.750
<b>You guys can't find the monster?</b>

15:23.750 --> 15:26.590
<b>The one that killed Blue
must still be alive!</b>

15:26.590 --> 15:28.570
<b>Leave no stone unturned!
 Yes, ma'am!</b>

15:29.920 --> 15:32.510
<b>To think that Blue Keeper
has been defeated…</b>

15:32.510 --> 15:33.680
<b>Curse that boss monster.</b>

15:33.680 --> 15:35.970
<b>They finally decided to appear now…</b>

15:35.970 --> 15:39.830
<b>I wonder how this string
of incidents will change the world…</b>

15:39.830 --> 15:43.650
<b>In any case, a change
within the Rangers is unavoidable.</b>

15:43.650 --> 15:47.340
<b>Yeah. The war against monsters
will begin again.</b>

15:49.840 --> 15:51.860
<b>We need more help.</b>

15:52.440 --> 15:56.450
<b>For starters,
maybe we should promote those cadets.</b>

15:59.350 --> 16:02.170
<b>And he's not even
an official Ranger yet…</b>

16:02.170 --> 16:06.130
<b>Why does it feel so vain
to become a righteous hero?</b>

16:06.130 --> 16:09.050
<b>Ishikawa achieved his dream
at the very end.</b>

16:09.050 --> 16:11.360
<b>He fulfilled his duty
without running away.</b>

16:11.880 --> 16:14.510
<b>I want to believe that
he found comfort in that.</b>

16:14.510 --> 16:16.850
<b>Usukubo… You…</b>

16:16.850 --> 16:18.870
<b>It's not just Ishikawa.</b>

16:18.870 --> 16:22.230
<b>It's likely that Koguma has been killed
by the monster as well.</b>

16:22.230 --> 16:23.370
<b>What?</b>

16:23.810 --> 16:24.980
<b>I saw it too.</b>

16:25.810 --> 16:28.150
<b>At least on the final day,</b>

16:28.150 --> 16:32.880
<b>a fighter was disguised as Koguma
during the fight against Blue Keeper.</b>

16:32.880 --> 16:34.660
<b>W-What's going on?</b>

16:34.660 --> 16:36.780
<b>Koguma's a monster,
and a monster is Koguma…</b>

16:36.780 --> 16:39.700
<b>All right.
Maybe you should stay quiet, Shippou.</b>

16:40.990 --> 16:42.890
<b>Is that true, Urabe?</b>

16:42.890 --> 16:46.540
<b>Yeah. I heard it
straight from that fighter.</b>

16:47.270 --> 16:52.240
<b>Ranmaru faced the boss monster
all alone and was defeated instead.</b>

16:53.240 --> 16:54.600
<b>No way…</b>

16:55.330 --> 16:56.570
<b>Koguma…</b>

16:56.570 --> 16:57.760
<b>However,</b>

16:58.630 --> 17:01.890
<b>I heard that right after the boss monster
pierced through his gut,</b>

17:01.890 --> 17:04.830
<b>someone transported him to an instructor.</b>

17:04.830 --> 17:07.020
<b>The instructor was able to provide
some first aid</b>

17:07.020 --> 17:08.940
<b>and stop his bleeding
with the Divine Artifact.</b>

17:08.940 --> 17:11.480
<b>Thanks to that,
we avoided the worst-case scenario.</b>

17:12.090 --> 17:14.700
<b>That's great! I'm so happy he's alive!</b>

17:14.700 --> 17:16.490
<b>But, who would…</b>

17:16.490 --> 17:18.350
<b>Right, Hibiki? Aren't you glad?</b>

17:18.350 --> 17:21.350
<b>Huh? Yes, I'm glad.</b>

17:21.350 --> 17:25.120
<b>Ranmaru, you were a splendid Ranger.</b>

17:25.620 --> 17:30.080
<b>I swear I'll find the fighter that escaped
and avenge you!</b>

17:30.790 --> 17:33.920
<b>We still don't have the right
to do that, though.</b>

17:33.920 --> 17:35.960
<b>Shut up, I know about that!</b>

17:37.130 --> 17:39.620
<b>I never expected to lose to you guys.</b>

17:39.620 --> 17:43.060
<b>I'm leaving things to you for now,
official Rangers.</b>

17:43.060 --> 17:44.730
<b>I'm sure you'll all be fine.</b>

17:44.730 --> 17:47.120
<b>After all, you guys defeated
that boss monster!</b>

17:47.120 --> 17:51.380
<b>So we're the up-and-coming newbies?
Sounds great to me!</b>

17:51.610 --> 17:53.820
<b>Kurusu, I think…</b>

17:53.820 --> 17:57.390
<b>You're more than qualified,
Yukino. I guarantee it.</b>

17:57.820 --> 18:00.890
<b>We'll carry on Ishikawa and Koguma's will.</b>

18:00.890 --> 18:02.890
<b>We're just getting started.</b>

18:02.890 --> 18:06.140
<b>That's right. Our battle hasn't ended yet.</b>

18:06.140 --> 18:08.750
<b>Not until the day
we eliminate the monsters!</b>

18:12.150 --> 18:14.670
<b>LIVE Blue Keeper deceased
Blue Divine Artifact yet to be found</b>

18:15.250 --> 18:16.880
<b>What happened to the rogue monster</b>

18:16.880 --> 18:18.160
<b>that appeared out of nowhere?</b>

18:18.160 --> 18:22.130
<b>Today, we talk to a Ranger
who was fighting at the scene.</b>

18:22.660 --> 18:25.220
<b>It goes without saying that
we dealt with it accordingly.</b>

18:25.220 --> 18:27.670
<b>Hisui's got it rough.</b>

18:27.670 --> 18:31.110
<b>Yesterday's incident
finally made it to the news.</b>

18:31.110 --> 18:34.110
<b>Aizome seems to be
more suited for roles like that,</b>

18:34.110 --> 18:38.450
<b>but it would be too cruel
to let her make PR appearances now.</b>

18:38.450 --> 18:39.740
<b>Ms. Hisui,</b>

18:39.740 --> 18:42.890
<b>citizens are worried that
monsters strong enough to defeat</b>

18:42.890 --> 18:45.080
<b>the Blue Keeper will begin to appear.</b>

18:45.080 --> 18:46.790
<b>There is no cause for concern.</b>

18:46.790 --> 18:51.650
<b>The Dragon Keepers as well as us rankers
will ensure everyone's safety.</b>

18:52.080 --> 18:55.340
<b>Looks like they're still trying
to hide the truth about the boss monster</b>

18:55.340 --> 18:56.650
<b>at a time like this.</b>

18:56.650 --> 19:01.010
<b>Still, the monsters were pretty bold
this time around.</b>

19:01.010 --> 19:04.090
<b>I suppose even the Rangers
were taken aback.</b>

19:06.340 --> 19:09.930
<b>I wonder how long they can keep
this secret under wraps.</b>

19:10.670 --> 19:15.170
<b>Yes. Peltrola has succeeded
in obtaining the item in question.</b>

19:15.600 --> 19:19.110
<b>Now that they've lost Blue,
the Rangers are in a state of chaos.</b>

19:19.110 --> 19:21.990
<b>This is the perfect chance to take action!</b>

19:21.990 --> 19:23.850
<b>The chance to do what?</b>

19:25.180 --> 19:27.930
<b>It isn't nice to hide things
from your superior.</b>

19:28.360 --> 19:31.460
<b>The Rangers is a workplace
with a cozy, friendly environment</b>

19:31.460 --> 19:34.440
<b>and open communication, you know?
</b>

19:34.440 --> 19:38.190
<b>Tell me. Which organization sent you?</b>

19:45.130 --> 19:49.710
<b>You guys are wrong.
We are the ones who are right!</b>

19:49.710 --> 19:52.580
<b>In that case, prove that to me!</b>

20:01.300 --> 20:03.470
<b>Sorry to keep
everyone waiting.</b>

20:04.970 --> 20:06.240
<b>That bastard…</b>

20:06.610 --> 20:09.060
<b>I never expected him to
keep his lips sealed until the end.</b>

20:09.490 --> 20:13.410
<b>Now, I think you guys probably
have a feeling about this already,</b>

20:14.060 --> 20:17.570
<b>but there's a traitor among the Rangers.</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:22.670
<b>Seems like
you're in a pretty good mood.</b>

20:24.920 --> 20:28.260
<b>Are you that happy
that one of our leaders died?</b>

20:29.000 --> 20:34.310
<b>Suzukiri. Can I assume that
you're an enemy of us Rangers?</b>

20:35.180 --> 20:38.110
<b>What's your reason
for helping the monsters?</b>

20:38.110 --> 20:41.260
<b>How upsetting.
You would suspect your comrade?</b>

20:41.260 --> 20:43.030
<b>Stop playing dumb!</b>

20:43.940 --> 20:47.030
<b>The cartridge from Red Divine Artifact
was supposedly stolen by a monster.</b>

20:47.760 --> 20:51.270
<b>The fact that you had it
proves everything!</b>

20:51.270 --> 20:54.790
<b>The moment you decided to keep quiet
and use it, you're already an accomplice.</b>

20:54.790 --> 20:58.420
<b>You better think of an excuse
to explain why you have it, okay?</b>

20:58.420 --> 21:04.030
<b>For the sake of your goal,
isn't it better for you to have it?</b>

21:04.030 --> 21:05.160
<b>Crap.</b>

21:05.160 --> 21:08.160
<b>It's too late to tell me to return it.</b>

21:08.160 --> 21:09.680
<b>Sure thing.</b>

21:10.660 --> 21:12.640
<b>For now, that is.</b>

21:13.590 --> 21:16.270
<b>Since I already got a new one.</b>

21:31.200 --> 21:37.000
<b>Four more left.
I'll defeat all of the Dragon Keepers!</b>

21:37.870 --> 21:42.460
<b>With only four left,
will the Dragon Keepers be able to win?</b>

21:42.460 --> 21:44.300
<b>Let's hear from the citizens.</b>

21:44.950 --> 21:48.450
<b>I think things are really
getting bad now that Blue's dead.</b>

21:48.450 --> 21:52.430
<b>I believe in the Rangers,
but I'm still a little worried.</b>

21:52.430 --> 21:54.500
<b>You can do it, Dragon Keepers!</b>

23:29.310 --> 23:31.470
<b>Translated by Qianni Lu</b>
